      <chord name="F"/>Happy <chord name="Gm"/>the home <chord name="F"/>that <chord name="Gm/D"/>welcomes <chord name="Dm/A"/>You, <chord name="C/G"/>Lord <chord name="F"/>Jesus,<br/>
