      <chord name="F"/>Happy <chord name="Gm"/>the <chord name="C/G"/>home <chord name="F"/>where <chord name="Gm/D"/>man <chord name="Gbm"/>and <chord name="Gm"/>wife <chord name="Dm/A"/>together<br/>
